[[File:Golovanova fruit detail.png|left|120px]]
'''Golovanova fruit''' is a type of fruit grown by planting [[golovanova seed]]s within the [[Tithe Farm]] [[minigame]], which requires level 34 [[Farming]] to plant.

Harvesting the fruit grants 6 Farming experience. Depositing the harvested fruit into a [[Sack (Tithe Farm)|sack]] grants an additional 60 experience for the first 74 fruit, for a total of 66 experience per fruit harvested. The 76th-100th fruit deposited each reward 120 experience, with an additional 1,500 experience for the 75th fruit only.

Leaving the Tithe Farm minigame, either through the door, teleporting, or any other means, will remove any harvested fruit from the players inventory, and reward 0 xp. However, the player can safely log out without losing any harvested fruit or seeds, as the player will be placed inside the minigame when logged back in. 

Upon attempting to eat the fruit you will receive a message stating {{mes|The scent doesn't appeal to you.}}

The fruit is named after [[Farmer Gricoller]]'s granddaughter [[Golova]].{{CiteNews|url=https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/community-showcase---october-2023?oldschool=1|title=Community Showcase - October 2023|newsdate=31 October 2023|quote=[are the fruits your farm specializes in named after your granddaughters, or are they named after the fruits?] As for your last question, the fruits are named after my granddaughters.}}

[[File:Bologano fruit detail.png|left|120px]]
'''Bologano fruit''' is a type of fruit grown by planting [[bologano seed]]s within the [[Tithe Farm]] [[minigame]], requiring level 54 [[Farming]] to plant.

Harvesting the fruit grants 14 Farming experience. Depositing the harvested fruit into a [[Sack (Tithe Farm)|sack]] grants an additional 140 experience for the first 74 fruit, for a total of 154 experience per fruit harvested. The 76th-100th fruit deposited each reward 260 experience, with an additional 3,500 experience for the 75th fruit  only.

Leaving the Tithe Farm minigame, either through the door, teleporting, or any other means, will remove any harvested fruit from the players inventory, and reward 0 xp. However, the player can safely log out without losing any harvested fruit or seeds, as the player will be placed inside the minigame when logged back in.

If you try to eat the fruit a chatbox message will appear saying {{mes|The scent doesn't appeal to you.}}

The fruit is named after [[Farmer Gricoller]]'s youngest granddaughter [[Bologa]].{{CiteNews|url=https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/community-showcase---october-2023?oldschool=1|title=Community Showcase - October 2023|newsdate=31 October 2023|quote=[are the fruits your farm specializes in named after your granddaughters, or are they named after the fruits?] As for your last question, the fruits are named after my granddaughters.}}

