'''Easter egg''' is an item obtained during the [[2022 Easter event]]. It is used alongside the [[ice cream easter egg]] to test the its durability under the desert heat. The normal Easter egg will melt into a [[melted easter egg]] in the process.

{{2022 Easter event}}

[[File:Melted easter egg detail.png|left|120px]]
'''Melted easter egg''' is an item obtained during the [[2022 Easter event]]. It is the result of melting an [[Easter egg (2022 Easter event)|easter egg]] during the Shantay Pass experiment, or from the [[ice cream easter egg]] melting when talking to the [[Easter Bunny]] at the end of the event. Upon finishing the event, all remaining easter eggs in the inventory will melt.

When eaten, it heals 1 [[Hitpoints|Hitpoint]], resulting in the following game message:

{{mes|You eat the melted Easter egg...<br>
...It tastes lovely and heals some health.}}

If you eat the melted easter egg with full health, the message is slightly different:

{{mes|You eat the melted Easter egg...<br>
...It tastes lovely.}}

Although useless, players were able to keep melted easter eggs after completion of the event. With the end of the event, all melted easter eggs were removed from the inventories of any players who still had them.

{{2022 Easter event}}

[[File:Ice cream easter egg detail.png|left|120px]]
'''Ice cream easter egg''' is an item obtained during the [[2022 Easter event]]. It is made of a normal [[Easter egg (2022 Easter event)|easter egg]] filled with camel milk ice cream, intended to keep the chocolate from melting in the desert heat. The ice cream easter egg doesn't melt during the Shantay Pass experiment, but melts into a [[melted easter egg]] when talking to the [[Easter Bunny]] at the end of the event.

{{2022 Easter event}}

