[[File:Kharidian quest lamp detail.png|130px|left]]'''Kharidian quest lamp''' is a lamp used to complete the Kharidian storyline, up to and including [[Beneath Cursed Sands]]. It can be purchased from the [[skull shop]] in the [[Deadman: Annihilation]] event for 1,500 skull points, or from the [[Emblem Trader]] in the [[Bounty Hunter Shop (Deadman Mode)|Bounty Hunter Shop]] on the permanent Deadman mode server for 2,000,000 archaic points.

Rubbing the lamp gives the message {{mes|You rub the lamp and {{Colour|red|complete the Desert quest storyline, up to Beneath Cursed Sands!}} Check the Quest List to see your new unlocks.}}

{{Deadman: Annihilation}}

