It does '''not''' complete [[Sins of the Father]].

Rubbing the lamp gives the message {{mes|You rub the lamp and {{Colour|red|complete the Myreque quest storyline, up to Night at the Theatre!}} Check the Quest List to see your new unlocks.}}

{{Deadman: Annihilation}}

