The '''Sigil of the Gods''' is an attunable combat sigil in [[Deadman: Annihilation]]. It gives 10% damage increase when using [[god spells]] against other players, with each god spell offering additional bonuses: [[Flames of Zamorak]] has a 10% chance to [[burn]], [[Claws of Guthix]] lowers the target's [[Defence]], and [[Saradomin Strike]] drains the target's [[Prayer points]].

In [[Deadman: Annihilation]], the un-attuned version can be purchased from the [[Deadman: Annihilation/Skull shop|skull shop]]. It can be activated by clicking ''Attune''. Up to three attunable sigils can be attuned at once. Duplicate sigils can be sold back to the skull shop by using them on the [[deadman's skull]].

