As with other supplies found in [[Vampyrium]], it cannot be consumed outside of that realm, with attempting to do so resulting in the "{{mes|Given you're not in a hostile environment where supplies aren't highly limited, you don't see any need to consume something as disgusting as this.}}" chat message.

Drinking the potion gives the message {{mes|You drink the putrid sticky potion. You feel oddly energetic.}}

