[[File:Jar of congealed blood detail.png|90px|left]]
A '''jar of congealed blood''' is a consumable item that can be obtained in [[Castle Drakan]] during the [[quest]] [[The Blood Moon Rises]]. Eating it will completely restore [[energy]], [[Hitpoints]] and [[Prayer]].

Jar of congealed blood is a strong emergency item due to the benefits it provides in one click. It is recommended to use this item as a last resort when hitpoints and prayer are as low as possible to maximise the benefit obtained from it. Dropping this item leads to it being destroyed.

As with other supplies found in [[Vampyrium]], it cannot be consumed outside of that realm, with attempting to do so resulting in the "{{mes|Given you're not in a hostile environment where supplies aren't highly limited, you don't see any need to consume something as disgusting as this.}}" chat message.

Eating the congealed blood gives the message {{mes|You eat the congealed blood. It tastes better than expected and leaves you feeling fully refreshed.}}

{{The Blood Moon Rises}}

[[File:Smelly kebab detail.png|left|100px]]
'''Smelly kebab''' is an untradeable food from [[The Blood Moon Rises]] quest. It heals 18 [[Hitpoints]] when eaten. It is a [[fast food]], a subtype of food that incurs non-standard attack or eating delays when consumed.

As with other supplies found in [[Vampyrium]], it cannot be consumed outside of that realm, with attempting to do so resulting in the "{{mes|Given you're not in a hostile environment where supplies aren't highly limited, you don't see any need to consume something as disgusting as this.}}" chat message.

Eating the kebab gives the message {{mes|You eat the smelly kebab. It tastes... unusual.}}

{{The Blood Moon Rises}}

[[File:Large hat detail.png|130px|left]]
A '''large hat''' can be found on southern [[Wyrmscraig]], near the west end of the [[Wyrmscraig Goat]] hunting area.

When investigated prior to beginning [[Fallen From Grace]], it gives the message {{mes|Someone's left their hat here. How odd.}} After starting the quest, investigating the large hat will play a cutscene the first time, then give the message {{mes|The hat appears to be hooked onto a rock. Could it be Keenan's?}}. After continuing through the quest, the message will change to {{mes|Likely Keenan's hat. Did he leave it here or lose it?}}<!--not totally sure when it switches, definitely at least after having entered the cavern and talked to mortimer--> After completion of the quest, the message becomes {{mes|Hopefully poor Keenan will be the last victim of the Mad Angel.}}

The large hat cannot be picked up by the player, nor can it be picked up via [[Telekinetic Grab]].

{{Fallen From Grace}}

[[File:Staircase key detail.png|130px|left]]
The '''staircase key''' is used to unlock the staircase under the cathedral during the quest [[Fallen From Grace]]. It is found by using a [[hammer]] or [[chisel]] on the [[ancient sunstone core]], or by destroying the core.

